{"id":"n16082-2-7","stage":3,"title":"알아주다 · 认可","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16082-2-7-1","ko":"저 사람이 누군데 주변에 사람들이 저렇게 많이 모여 있어?","zh":"那个人是谁啊，为什么周围有那么多人聚在一起？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"누군데","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누군데","audio":"/audio/6c00b389fc2a57d5c565.mp3"}},{"text":"주변에","meaning":"周围，周边","explanation":"주변：周围，周边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주변","audio":"/audio/09bfd0c3a7d1a7b22fbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61415","senseId":"1","lemma":"주변","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주변에","audio":"/audio/974dd41667ce949e7735.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],